@startuml PropORACLE_Grading
' Grading — 3AM grader, leg classification, void-aware settlement in eval
' Render: PlantUML extension or https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml

title PropORACLE — Grading

actor "Task Scheduler\n(3AM)" as Sched
participant "run_grader.ps1" as Grader
participant "Sport actuals\n(ESPN / boxes / period CSVs)" as Actuals
participant "find_ticket_payload_path" as Resolve
participant "combined_ticket_grader.py" as TickGrade
participant "build_ticket_eval.py" as Eval
participant "grade_history.json" as Hist
participant "/grades · /income" as UI

Sched -> Grader : grade yesterday (N-1)
Grader -> Actuals : fetch / join actuals\n(WNBA1H/1Q never fall back to full-game)
Actuals --> Grader : per-prop actuals

Grader -> Resolve : resolve ticket card for date
note right of Resolve
  **Current code order (build_ticket_eval.py):**
  1) combined_slate_tickets_{date}.xlsx
     (prefer fullest workbook)
  2) goblin-only JSON fallbacks
  3) combined_slate_tickets_{date}.json
     (nonempty groups preferred)
  4) tickets_latest.json if date matches

  **Gap (Sep 19–23 class):** an empty /
  sport-slate-only xlsx beats a good JSON
  → UNGRADED / empty Income day.
  Intended: nonempty JSON before empty xlsx
  (not fully flipped yet).
end note
Resolve --> Grader : path (xlsx or JSON)

Grader -> TickGrade : grade slip legs vs actuals
TickGrade --> Grader : per-leg HIT / MISS / VOID / NO_ACTUAL
note right of TickGrade
  **Classifies legs only.**
  Injury / DNP fills, NO_ACTUAL,
  NO_FG_MADE, anytime_td alias.
  Unacceptable voids flagged
  (validate_unacceptable_voids.py).
end note

Grader -> Eval : classified legs
note right of Eval
  **Settles slips.**
  VOID / NO_ACTUAL leg → dropped;
  slip pays the smaller-leg
  N-correct multiplier.
  <2 playable legs → refund / no contest.
  (Voids move payouts, not just hygiene.)
end note
Eval -> Eval : ticket_eval_<date>.html\ngraded_props_<date>.json
Eval -> Hist : append W / L / voids per track
note right of Hist
  **Income WR tracks (MAIN):**
  graded_main, and high_prob_std_gob
  (MAIN row name since Sep 19).
  standard_yolo + goblin70_yolo +
  shadows / long_parlay → separate;
  **not** in day-to-day Income WR.
end note
Eval --> UI : Grades hub + /income
Grader -> Grader : git commit graded_props JSON\n+ ticket_eval HTML

note over Grader, UI
  Completion check lives in run_daily.ps1:
  a sport counts as graded only if its own
  graded_<sport>_*.xlsx exists (e.g. CFB when
  step8_cfb_direction_clean* is present).
  Published G70 cards are **not** re-gated here —
  keep revalidation is scrub_goblin70_keep_live.py.
end note

@enduml
